<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/appliesFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/appliesFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applies for"@en .
