<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/appliesFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an agent and something for which that agent applies, for example a job, membership of an organization, or a grant from a funding agency."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/appliesFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/appliesFor> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-person a foaf:Person ;\n        frapo:appliesFor :my-grant .\n    " .
